title: mf:duplicate
tags: [[GUI command]] Duplicates
kind: reference
summary: Scan the active repository for byte-identical files (mf duplicate scan)

`mf:duplicate scan` is the GUI half of `mf duplicate scan`: the whole-repository
scan, with the task bar's progress ([[Finding duplicates]]). Its options stay on
the command line. A cancelled scan is an outcome, not an error: what it found is
kept.
